infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Same hotspot, wrong vs right fix family
  desc renderTemplate at 28% self-time — the category you diagnose decides the payoff
  compares
    - label Wrong family — treat it as CPU-bound
      children
        - label Rewrite algorithm: 2x local at best
          desc Swapping template engines treats the leaf as CPU-bound — the wrong family
        - label Service p99 only ~1.16x (Amdahl)
          desc 28% of wall-time sped 2x moves the headline ~5% — hours of work for nothing
        - label GC pressure unchanged
          desc The real cost (fmt.Sprintf + string concat allocation) is never touched
    - label Right family — it is allocation-bound
      children
        - label Kill allocation: 4.7x local
          desc A pre-sized strings.Builder removes Sprintf + concat — the right family
        - label Service p99 ~1.30x (Amdahl)
          desc p99 drops 380 ms -> 220 ms once the allocator stops dominating
        - label GC frame width -60%
          desc fmt.Sprintf leaves the alloc profile; renderTemplate self-time 28% -> 6%
theme
  palette #f43f5e #14b8a6
